<title>NETHERLANDS: Wesselius rates ASM Intl a Buy.</title>
<headline>Wesselius rates ASM Intl a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 30 research.</p>
<p>    Company------------------Sector--------Price---Broker-------</p>
<p>    ASM International    semiconductors    26.50    Wesselius</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy. Group has developed new range of tools aimed at high-growth sector of semiconductor industry. Semiconductor equipment market set to recover in 2nd half. Group last year completed financial restructuring and can finance growth without tapping markets in next two years.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	2.34     n/a     11.4	 nil</p>
